    a: 'It depends on what each specific option offers, not on internship vs full-time as categories. A structured internship with real mentorship, defined tasks, and a fair stipend at a strong employer can outweigh a weak full-time offer at an unknown company. A genuine full-time offer with ownership and income stability usually outweighs a vague, unpaid internship with no defined learning.',
  },
