      <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/assessments">Free career and skill assessments</a> give you that starting signal. When the decision is bigger than one offer — family pressure, a confusing set of options, or genuine uncertainty about direction — <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career guidance built around your specific offers and timeline</a> works through the trade-offs with you.
    </p>
  </div>

